OHOS: host access layer for the sandboxed desktop. Drop-in readFile,
writeFile, mkdir, rm, stat and execFile that forward profile files and CLI
calls to the desktop bridge on the host (loopback HTTP with a pairing secret),
and pass everything else through to the local implementation.

